      "number": 2,
      "pali": "14. Oghavagga ",
      "english": "14. Floods "
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "pali": "Oghasutta ",
      "english": "Floods "
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "pali": "Sāvatthinidānaṁ. ",
      "english": "At Sāvatthī. "
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "pali": "“Cattārome, bhikkhave, oghā. ",
      "english": "“Mendicants, there are these four floods. "
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "pali": "Katame cattāro? ",
      "english": "What four? "
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "pali": "Kāmogho, bhavogho, diṭṭhogho, avijjogho—",
      "english": "The floods of sensuality, desire to be reborn, views, and ignorance. "
    },
    {
      "number": 8,
      "pali": "ime kho, bhikkhave, cattāro oghā. ",
      "english": "These are the four floods. "
    },
    {
      "number": 9,
      "pali": "Imesaṁ kho, bhikkhave, catunnaṁ oghānaṁ abhiññāya pariññāya parikkhayāya pahānāya …pe… ayaṁ ariyo aṭṭhaṅgiko maggo bhāvetabbo”ti. ",
      "english": "The noble eightfold path should be developed for the direct knowledge, complete understanding, finishing, and giving up of these four floods.” "
    },
    {
      "number": 10,
      "pali": "(Yathā esanā, evaṁ vitthāretabbaṁ.) ",
      "english": "(Tell in full as in the section on searches.) "
    },
    {
      "number": 11,
      "pali": "Paṭhamaṁ. ",
      "english": ""
    }
  ]
